      "aiContext": "## Festo VR Innovation Lab\n\nWelcome to the **Festo VR Innovation Lab**—a dedicated space for exploring new ideas, technologies, and immersive experiences.\n\nThe lab is equipped with **four Meta Quest 3 VR headsets** and a wall-mounted display, enabling teams to collaborate, demonstrate virtual environments, and conduct innovative experiments.\n\nThis space will be used to:\n\n* Test new VR and mixed-reality applications\n* Conduct innovation experiments\n* Develop and validate creative ideas\n* Support immersive learning and training\n* Encourage collaboration and technology exploration\n\nThe Festo VR Innovation Lab is where imagination meets technology—creating new opportunities to experiment, learn, and shape the future.\n"
